---
description: Python conventions — uv, Ruff, ty, package layout under src/swarm_sdk
globs: **/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Python

- Package lives under `src/swarm_sdk/`. Match existing naming and patterns there.
- Formatter/linter: **Ruff** (`line-length = 100`, `py314`). Typecheck: **ty**.
- Prefer `uv add` / `pyproject.toml` + lockfile. Use `uv run …`.
- No new `# noqa` / `# type: ignore` / skip/xfail without a named rule and reason.
- After editing library-facing Python, run **Context7** on the relevant package, then tighten.
- New modules: start from [`.cursor/templates/python_static_template.py`](../templates/python_static_template.py) (`@wrappers` + role classes/functions). See `python-static-template` rule.

## Quality gate (before claiming done)

```bash
uv run --extra dev --extra observability --extra opencl --extra faiss --extra mem0 pytest Agents/benchmark -q
uv run --extra dev --extra observability --extra opencl --extra faiss --extra mem0 ruff check src Agents/benchmark Main
uv run --extra dev --extra observability --extra opencl --extra faiss --extra mem0 ty check src Agents/benchmark Main
uv run python -m swarm_sdk.agents.validate
```
